{"id":"664716","name":"鸡蛋泡泡","author":"阳台上的草莓","authorId":"7597089","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664716/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"水","amount":"280g"},{"name":"油","amount":"20g"}],"sub":[{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"3g"},{"name":"油","amount":"800g（炸）"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"盆里放鸡蛋，油，盐，水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664716/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入面粉，酵母粉。","img":"images/664716/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用筷子搅拌均匀无干粉。","img":"images/664716/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"发酵2倍大。","img":"images/664716/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入切碎的青椒，胡萝卜，火腿肠。","img":"images/664716/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀静置10分钟。","img":"images/664716/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒锅放油烧五成热，用勺子舀入面糊中小火炸。","img":"images/664716/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炸至金黄即可。","img":"images/664716/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/664716/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/664716/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}